set up mode remote in 4 steps:
  1. replace /Users/user_name/.config/agent-wt/remote-model-server.token with the pasted token (mode 0600; the old token there is lost)
  2. unload the LaunchAgent: launchctl bootout gui/501/local.wt-model.serve
  3. remove the LaunchAgent plist /Users/user_name/Library/LaunchAgents/local.wt-model.serve.plist
  4. create [model-server] in /Users/user_name/.config/agent-wt/config.toml: mode = "remote", url = "https://gpu.example:8787", token_file = "/Users/user_name/.config/agent-wt/remote-model-server.token"
left alone and notes:
  - keep the local token file /Users/user_name/.config/wt-model/server.token
  - the server at https://gpu.example:8787 was not checked
